{"name": "Nothing Unusual", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.st.dl.eccdnx.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/cf8093b0193a530be00da77d65c79353.avif?t=1788082889\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stuff your backpack with all sorts of strange things, fight solo or with friends, and survive an absurd day.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Monsters are crawling out of the city\u2019s corners. Sticks, thermoses and umbrellas are your gear.<br/>Arrange, merge and mix elements to last until dark. After all, monsters need sleep too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/bd39095e88baa76752fcd50b46ead0af.poster.avif?t=1794508539\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/bd39095e88baa76752fcd50b46ead0af.webm?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/bd39095e88baa76752fcd50b46ead0af.mp4?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.st.dl.eccdnx.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/4bd7fef4ac74b84031877a0e5f7c480d.avif?t=1788082889\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every slot in your backpack can change the next battle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Survive a wave, pick up something new at the street stall, and fit it into your backpack.<br/>Rearrange, upgrade and merge your gear, then put your build to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/73b4b5424393582a3729d11752616580.poster.avif?t=1794508539\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/73b4b5424393582a3729d11752616580.webm?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/73b4b5424393582a3729d11752616580.mp4?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.st.dl.eccdnx.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/e70f409de122e1de0d7940a0d81db063.avif?t=1788082889\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sticks, frying pans, frozen cutlassfish\u2026 anything at hand can be a weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/e0eabc4fbeae6334d914e063c3837ffd.poster.avif?t=1794508539\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/e0eabc4fbeae6334d914e063c3837ffd.webm?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/e0eabc4fbeae6334d914e063c3837ffd.mp4?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Add fire, ice, electricity or poison to give even the same stick a new trick.<br/>Traps, pets, even plants and musical instruments can join the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.st.dl.eccdnx.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/4e8bbe0d4e3c6871dcb8d5f5c116ef99.avif?t=1788082889\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Four ordinary people. Four unusual ways to start.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Azure the student plays with marbles and elements; Scarlet the police officer excels at ranged combat.<br/>Moss the repair worker pilots a mech; Violet the journalist brings a Soul-Snatching Camcorder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/ef8fb2111796332f47c23dfb44158219.poster.avif?t=1794508539\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/ef8fb2111796332f47c23dfb44158219.webm?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/ef8fb2111796332f47c23dfb44158219.mp4?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.st.dl.eccdnx.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/4142e3331b7cf0d74c34afc38daa4e10.avif?t=1788082889\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A new wave might bring a new set of rules.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u201cThe Fog Rolls In\u201d limits your vision; \u201cThe One in the Mirror\u201d reverses left and right.<br/>Whatever rule comes your way, think on your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/49866bf9368b1b4096c33ae0963fddc2.poster.avif?t=1794508539\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/49866bf9368b1b4096c33ae0963fddc2.webm?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/49866bf9368b1b4096c33ae0963fddc2.mp4?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.st.dl.eccdnx.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/bf1084ae5b6dbef2ab2b42d81daa4d98.avif?t=1788082889\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive the hordes. Something bigger is waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keep going and confront the city\u2019s strange transformations. Try not to look too surprised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/f06b2bb13ae85ccdea266e9d90581e71.poster.avif?t=1794508539\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/f06b2bb13ae85ccdea266e9d90581e71.webm?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/f06b2bb13ae85ccdea266e9d90581e71.mp4?t=1794508539\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.st.dl.eccdnx.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/extras/645c9db6f26f7144e496fe495f511870.avif?t=1788082889\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 characters, solo play or multiplayer co-op</li><li>Over 300 items, including over 50 weapons and over 20 backpacks</li><li>Over 100 fusion recipes for different combat builds</li><li>13 Rule Tales, over 20 monster types and 2 boss battles</li><li>36 Steam achievements and support for 13 languages</li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Nothing Unusual is a light backpack-building arena survival roguelike. The city\u2019s gone weird; monsters are crawling out of the cracks. Fight with sticks, thermoses, umbrellas and odder things: arrange, merge and mix elements in your backpack, and last until dark. After all, monsters need sleep too.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5198040/098f39aa1a77e8ea356ac36cdcb2af8aa2ae6a39/header.jpg?t=1794508539", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Inventory Management", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Casual", "Online Co-Op", "Surreal"], "developers": "SleepingMass", "publishers": "SleepingMass", "release_date": "Dec 3, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5198040", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/b6JW-Crw_sg", "first_seen": 1794438000.0, "review_rank": 5}